    "body": "[A10] **Owner decision, 2026-11-15:** block-RAM usage is kept loose for now; an image may go past its ROM ledger entry.\n\n- The ledger caps (56 per point; the 8x8/2if size fixture's 58.5, and its 59.0 entry, now ratified; the platform's 60.5) are no longer stop conditions for the flip lanes.\n- An image past its entry raises the entry to its measured size, at the next half tile, as named debt owed to S14 (cold code and descriptors to QSPI, decision D3). Each round and the flip PR report every image's ROM.\n- Still gating: the image fits the device and the build meets timing at every corner.\n- Revisited at S14, the first lane after the flip.\n",
